{{/*
Shared helper for the Telegram messages, which Alertmanager sends with
parse_mode=HTML: any free text that lands in the body (alert name, summary,
organization or system name, FQDN) must have &, < and > escaped or the
Telegram API rejects the whole message and the notification is lost.
Labels and annotations are produced by the appliances, so they are user
input from the template's point of view.

reReplaceAll(pattern, repl, text) is part of Alertmanager's default function
map; in a pipeline the piped value becomes the trailing text argument.
*/}}
{{ define "tg_esc" }}{{ . | reReplaceAll "&" "&amp;" | reReplaceAll "<" "&lt;" | reReplaceAll ">" "&gt;" }}{{ end }}
